{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/836593-hello-and-where-is-the-art-photos","id":836593,"title":"Hello, and where is the art/photos ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-24T12:35:03-08:00","id":836593,"title":"Hello, and where is the art/photos ?","content":"Hello ! I'm new to the forum, not sure this is the right place to present myself.<br /> I'm a artist and I love to draw, rpg is a lot of inspiration for me. After a quick search on the forum I noticed there is no drawing or any art, is that forbidden here ? The photos tab seems to be empty too.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11329-neowuf","name":"Neowuf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11329_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T13:57:57-08:00","id":836666,"title":"","content":"People post <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge\">fan art</a> all the time, at least in the Exalted Forum. All the art is related to the Onyx Paths games in some way. You have to host the image file yourself; you can't upload the file to the forum's servers.<br /> <br /> I am not a mod or affiliated with Onyx Path in anyway. I just give them money and they give me rpgs. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-24-2016, 05:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"htt